Saikou saikyou aashi no make, tension oni age

00:01:19.630 --> 00:01:22.960
Yasai mashi mashi karame mashi abura mashi mashi ninniku oome

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:25.170
Okaerinasaimase butagoya e

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:29.080
Hey! (Yeah!) Watashi no maid way! (Fuu!)

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:31.830
