Hey! (Yeah!) Meido no princess! (Fuu!)

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:38.880
Oshite kunnakya Baan! Baan! Baan! (Okay)

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:40.920
Pannier mau daikaiten

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.670
Maid kissa de kakurenbo

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:44.380
Nice okyuuji daiseikyou

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:46.210
Renai wa no no

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:48.540
Himitsu no hanazono

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:54.670
A Blood-soaked Ballgame:

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:54.670
The Kyun of Victory Shines On You

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:54.670
Manami, our dear comrade...

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:58.750
I can only imagine the regret you must feel
from never realizing your dream

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:00.670
of setting off a Big Bang in Akiba.

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:07.040
But the vivid stardust memory you leave behind
lives on in our hearts.

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:09.080
What the hell is this?

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:11.830
Why'd we have to hold Miss Manami's funeral
in such a dingy place?

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:13.420
With all the mess with the merger,

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:16.080
Creatureland probably didn't have time
to make arrangements.

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:18.540
"Merger"?! How is this a merger?

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:21.750
We work for Creatureland now
and the Maidalien name is gone.

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:23.380
It was a friggin' takeover.

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:25.750
You have a problem with Ms. Ugaki's decision?

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.670
Stop that.
We're at a funeral.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:31.880
Now that the Creatures and
Extraterrestrials have joined hands,

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:34.170
Miss Manami must be smiling up in the stars above.

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:38.130
If it isn't the fellow from Creatureland.

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:39.710
And who's this?

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:42.040
This is the manager of the Oinky Doink Cafe.

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:43.040
Go.

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:44.500
Oinky Doink Cafe?!

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:50.380
Please accept my deepest condolences for your loss.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:53.790
We appreciate you coming all this way for us.

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:56.580
Such an unexpected tragedy.

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:58.960
These must be such difficult times for you.

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:00.170
You're one to talk!

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:05.420
Having lived your lives as alien invaders,
you may find some of our ways odd.

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:08.750
If there is anything we as
more experienced Creatures can do-

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:13.130
Ms. Ugaki and the others have already made
a fabulous start as Creatures.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:15.460
Their profits have already exceeded that of Oinky Doink.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:18.420
With the axolotl as their theme,

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:22.040
they have rebranded themselves as
the Memory Lane Animal Cafe Axolotls.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.580
You think axolotls are Creatures?

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:26.210
Of course they're Creatures!

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:27.630
What's all this commotion?

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:29.460
Boss!

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:39.210
Settle the score with this!

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.420
A friendly game of baseball?

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:44.420
This is an order from our head.

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:46.790
The order is to play baseball?

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.540
Count me out; can't be bothered.

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:52.040
Playing ball after we tried to murder each other?
For real?

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:53.250
Let's do it!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.420
We'll wash away our past differences with our sweat!

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:58.330
As maids, we couldn't ask for a more peaceful solution!

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.790
How could that possibly end peacefully?

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:02.170
We'll make sure it does!

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:05.080
We'll all chase after the ball together
and patch things up!

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:07.500
Yeah, yeah, we just have to play along for show.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:10.040
No! If we're going to do this, we have to go for the win!

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:11.630
Someone's fired up.

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:14.750
But can you play baseball with just seven people?

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:29.880
For all those who fell in the recent ruckus,
a moment of silence!

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:34.750
<i>Nerula, you just watch.</i>

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:37.830
<i>I promise you we'll all make up during this game!</i>

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.830
He said a moment of silence, prick!

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:44.540
I mean, do we really have to play ball?

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.040
We all know who won.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.630
Whaddaya mean by that, huh?!

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:51.880
Well, like, you quit being aliens and
now you're just accelotooties.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.330
That's axolotls, twerp!

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:54.960
Don't you get cocky with us, bottom feeder!

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:55.790
Excuse me?

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:56.790
Stop that!

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:59.420
Bottom feeders like them have their own struggles.

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:00.710
Bottom feeders, huh?

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:01.710
You see,

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:06.380
I've been impressed by how unfazed you seem to be
despite being ridiculed as a burden to Creatureland.

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:08.670
Hey, let's just have some fun!

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:12.250
This match is partly to commemorate you
becoming axomorons, after all.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.460
Oh, or was it asshole tootles?

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:16.170
That's right!

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.290
We can settle this with baseball!

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.330
Come on everyone!
Let's play each other fair and square!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:25.500
Damn it, we'll take you out, fucking pigs!

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:32.540
Forced to change our persona by Creatureland,
our honor as extraterrestrials trampled,

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:35.080
I know all too well how frustrated you are.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.750
This is war!

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:39.960
Go show 'em how we're eons out of their league!

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:41.580
This is war!

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:42.580
No it's not!

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:44.380
Who're they calling a burden on Creatureland?!

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:45.960
I don't care what dirty tricks you use.

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:47.250
Go crush them!

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:48.250
We can't!

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:49.920
Playing rough is out of the question!

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:53.000
Chief, we have to win at baseball, fair and square!

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:56.130
If we don't want Nerula and the others
to have been sacrificed in vain,

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:58.250
we can't resort to violence now.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.960
There's no point if don't play fair!

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.170
Let's do this!

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.250
Axolotls

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.250
Oinky Doink

00:06:06.210 --> 00:06:08.040
Pitcher ~ Zoya

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.580
Catcher ~ Nagomi

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:09.580
Second!

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:11.380
Second Base ~  Yumechi

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:11.380
Short!

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:13.290
Shortstop ~ Shiipon

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.290
Yumechi! Shiipon!

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:14.960
I can't hear you two!

00:06:14.960 --> 00:06:16.920
She's like, more of a pain than usual, huh?

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.080
First!

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:20.380
First Base ~ Okachimachi

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:20.130
Third!

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:22.330
Third Base ~ Ranko

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.290
Now to the pitcher!

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:25.080
Come on, outfield!
Let's hear some noise! Holler!

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:25.960
Left Field ~ Jose

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:25.960
Hola!

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:26.830
Hola!

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:26.830
Center Field ~ Luis

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:27.790
Hola!

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:27.790
Right Field ~ Antonio

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:29.040
Who're they?

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:31.920
Venezuelans that Chief recruited, apparently.

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:34.710
Zoya says we can't communicate with them.

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.500
Play ball!

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:44.790
What're you looking at?

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.380
All fired up, huh?

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:49.580
Kasumi really looked up to Miss Manami.

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:56.710
I'll send the ball up where you are, Miss Manami!

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:09.380
Out!

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:10.880
That pitch came in nice and fast!

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:12.250
Great work, great work!

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.080
Goddamn it.

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.460
Get out there and go shut 'em out!

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:29.290
Hey, hey, hey!

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.460
Their pitcher isn't warmed up yet!

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:33.080
First pitch'll be nice and easy!

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:34.710
You gotta swing at that first pitch!

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:36.750
This is such a drag...

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:40.960
Crap! I didn't mean to hit that!

00:07:41.630 --> 00:07:42.830
Nice batting!

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:45.080
Pitcher's off to a bad start!

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:46.290
This is our chance!

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:52.790
What're you doing, idiot?!
Yes!

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:55.040
Hey, you!

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:56.250
Lucky for us!

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:57.540
Go, Yumechi!

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:00.380
Why the heck am I on base?

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:02.210
Lead off, lead off!

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:03.710
Runner's gonna run!

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.330
I so don't wanna run.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:16.170
Good work, good work!

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:24.080
You got baseball experience?

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:26.330
Just a bit, in the joint.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:28.080
Strike!

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:29.500
Strike!

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:31.830
Batter, you've gotta swing to hit the ball!

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:33.210
You hear that?

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:35.380
I shall swing, then.

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:46.920
Back home! Back home!

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:52.540
Hey, hey! You're wasting our time, amphibians!

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:55.040
What the hell're you all doing?!

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:58.790
I actually used to play softball!

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:01.830
Strike!

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:04.000
Ooh, I got this, I got this!

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:05.710
There!

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:08.290
Strike! Batter out!

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:10.500
Yup, I've got the timing down.

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:14.170
Never mind, never mind!
Shake it off, team!

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:22.210
All right! Crush those amphibians!

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.830
Come on, secret weapon!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:25.960
Shut him out if you wanna live!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:31.670
Bal-

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:34.040
Strike!

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:35.290
Oh, wow.

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:39.330
Batter out!

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:42.420
Isn't baseball huge in Venezuela?

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:44.500
What's the deal with those people?

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:48.830
Study abroad students who were in
Electric Town to buy cameras.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:53.500
The fair play ends here.

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:55.830
Go crush them.

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:58.500
Got it.

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:02.580
Right, let the real game begin, starting now.

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:09.880
Strike!

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:13.040
She's not gonna hit it!
Batter's blind, batter's blind!

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:15.750
Oh, I'll hit it this time.

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:28.420
Nagomi!

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:30.500
Nagomi!

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:32.250
Nagomi, are you all right?!

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:33.790
Chief, call an ambulance!

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:35.080
Huh? An ambulance?!

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:36.710
What's the big fuss?

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:38.580
I just nicked her a bit.

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:40.580
Oops, sorry.

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:41.960
Wh-why you!

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:44.170
What? You're the one who started it.

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:44.710
Say that again!

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:45.960
Asking for a pounding, huh?!
Say that again!

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:48.580
N-no! Please, no violence!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.000
I-I interfered!

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.880
I leaned in too close.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:55.460
What?

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:57.420
Catcher's interference!
Batter goes to first!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:00.000
Why?! That axomoron's the one to blame!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.960
I think you should go rest.

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:05.210
I want to see this match through to the end.

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:11.130
Okay, let's keep our chins up!

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:20.920
Yumechi?!

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:22.920
I just tagged her out.

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:25.130
That was more than that, you bastard!

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.500
Crush 'em! Crush 'em all!

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:31.710
Why?!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.130
Why do you resort to violence?!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:37.040
Because this is my all-out knuckleball!

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:39.460
Huh? What are you saying?!

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:40.960
This isn't baseball at all!

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:43.170
You're the only one playing baseball, Nagomi.

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:45.330
Then what are the rest of you doing?

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:47.170
Being a maid!

00:11:57.380 --> 00:11:58.380
Safe!

00:11:58.380 --> 00:11:59.790
What the hell, bitch?!

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:04.330
Th-this won't change anything...

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:07.170
We have to win, playing baseball!

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:12.170
Axolotls

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:12.170
Oinky Doink

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:10.170
Good, we've turned the tables!

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:12.170
Don't give them any more runs.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:15.250
Hey, you take out a maid or two, too.

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.250
Right!

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:18.080
They're totally coming for us.

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:19.710
Well, I'm ready to rumble.

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:29.080
Should I shorten my grip a fist and go swish?

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:31.630
Or else, maybe go fwoosh?

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.580
<i>No, this is a slider.</i>

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:37.790
<i>It's going to break from here, and-</i>

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:40.130
Nagomi!

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:41.130
Those pricks!

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:43.670
I... I'm fine!

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:45.580
I'll put pressure on them out on base.

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:46.880
Good luck at bat!

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:51.040
She'll wind up dead real fast at this rate.

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:53.250
That kid...

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:57.960
Going, going, going, going, going, going, going-

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:00.540
Out! That's three outs!

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:01.540
Switch!

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:03.210
Let's finish this off!

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:05.040
Go crush every last one of them!

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:05.920
Right!

00:13:05.920 --> 00:13:08.130
You two there, are you listening?

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:10.790
There's a maid out there playing fair and square.

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:13.710
There's a maid out there playing fair and square!

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:16.380
What, are you arguing with me?

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:17.960
She's out there playing fair and-

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:19.920
You'd better not say fair again, you-

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:22.330
Wh-why you!

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:23.460
Out!

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:26.750
Wh-why you little...

00:13:27.710 --> 00:13:28.960
Hey, get back here!

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:31.250
What? Ranko's playing fair now, too?

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.880
But a maid shouldn't put up with crap, right?

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:36.670
Provoking the enemy is a futile exercise.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:38.170
Futile?

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:40.130
Axo axo axo axo axo!

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:43.580
Want me to keep snipping off your limbs
until they stop growing back?!

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:45.630
Shut up, you bottom feeder pig!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:47.170
That's futile, all right.
Yeah? Yeah?

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:53.080
Shiipon!

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:54.080
Take that!

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:55.460
Out!

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:58.460
Yumechi! Shiipon!

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:01.500
I just want to get this over with.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.380
Let's finish them off already.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.130
You knuckleheads!

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:08.460
Aren't you ashamed this is so close, huh?!

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:11.630
Axolotls

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:11.630
Oinky Doink

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:10.920
Time out!

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:13.500
How long ago did this happen?!

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:15.040
Your nail's totally split!

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:17.460
I can pitch if I rip the whole thing off.

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.040
Uh, no way!

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.080
But I mean, who's gonna pitch?

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:23.630
Allow me.

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.290
Ranko?!

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:26.710
But you're still injured!

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.210
I can do it.

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:31.000
All right.

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.420
Ranko, I'm counting on you.

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:38.750
Come on everyone, let's make sure we win!

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:39.960
Oinky Doink...

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:40.420
Oink!

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:40.830
Oink!
Oink!

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:41.250
Oink!

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:41.580
Oink!
Oink!

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:42.000
Oink!

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:42.330
Oink!
Oink!

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:43.330
Doink doink!

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:45.830
On fire, you'll see that even piggies bare their fangs!

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:46.830
Oink!

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:48.630
Listen up, Kasumi!

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:50.750
Do whatever you've got to do to get out on-

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:53.130
Hey, are you even listening?!

00:14:53.130 --> 00:14:53.630
Hey, Kasumi?! Kasumi!

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:55.500
Um, I think she's talking to you.
Hey, Kasumi?! Kasumi!

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:56.130
We don't need tricks to take down the likes of you.

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:58.210
We don't need tricks to take down the likes of you.
Do your ears need cleaning? Huh?!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.380
Do your ears need cleaning? Huh?!

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:00.790
We won't lose!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:08.000
Strike!

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:13.540
Batter out!

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:14.790
Damn it!

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:17.420
At this rate...

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:21.130
If we lose to these bottom feeder pigs,
our reputation is done for!

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:23.460
Umpire! I'm the pinch hitter!

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:24.290
Huh?

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:25.460
Is that allowed?!

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:29.210
I can't let things end like this.

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:33.290
I'm the head of the Maidalien Group, you know.

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:36.580
No lowly swine is going to, is going to...

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:38.630
Strike!

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:46.710
Want me to turn you into a pirozhki?!

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:48.000
Why, you!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:49.960
Are you fucking kidding me?!

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:52.250
You lot never learn, huh?!

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:54.830
Stop! No one's gonna hit anyone!

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:57.500
You little...

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:05.170
What the hell d'ya think you're doing?!

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:11.250
I did it, Miss Manami!

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:13.500
Mi-Miyabi...

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:16.170
Why you...

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:20.630
Y-you!

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:32.080
R-Ranko, call an ambulance!

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:39.170
How? How could this happen?!

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:41.290
I wanted to play a match.

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:44.580
Just a proper game of baseball, with no bloodshed!

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:52.000
Considering we've had some actual casualties-

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.210
They're not dead.

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:55.630
Hey, what are you-

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:57.380
That's right, they're not dead!

00:16:57.380 --> 00:16:58.380
Right?!

00:16:58.380 --> 00:17:00.580
That's right!
They're not dead!

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:02.920
Ms. Ugaki, let's get back to the bench.

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:05.460
C'mon, let's go, axolotl mascot!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.170
Huh? They're not dead?

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:09.330
Well yeah, that's what they said.

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:11.790
Yay! Then we can keep playing!

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:14.460
All right! Shall we turn things up a notch?

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:16.500
Then we'll restart the game right away!

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.080
We're going to win!

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:19.080
Yeah!

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:24.960
Their coach looks super intense, huh?

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:27.170
Can't they adjust her angle a bit?

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:29.460
Out!

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:32.290
Okay, let's finish this game off!

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:34.130
Two outs! Two outs!

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:40.830
Dead ball!

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:42.460
Hey, that's dirty!

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:43.750
Shut up!

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.250
It's down to you, Elle!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:49.920
I know a lot happened, but we got this far!

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:52.750
The Axolotls are playing properly now, too.

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:56.580
I'm sure we're about to achieve something amazing!

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.250
We've got to win this!

00:17:58.500 --> 00:17:59.540
Okie dokie!

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:01.250
Oinky Doink!

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:18.460
Those are some nice pitches.

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:21.130
Elle...

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:23.460
Show 'em what we're made of!

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:26.920
Let's go, Elle, let's go!

00:18:26.920 --> 00:18:30.080
Let's go, Elle, let's go!

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:33.540
Let's go, Elle, let's go!

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:36.330
Sorry, but I can't let you win.

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:38.580
We can't afford to lose, either.

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:43.000
<i>Because beyond this game,
I'm sure a new future is waiting for us maids!</i>

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:47.330
I'll end this with the next pitch.

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.580
Batter out!

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:59.080
That's the game!

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:00.710
We did it...

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:03.500
We did it!

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:05.080
All right!

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:13.500
Damn it, those pigheads really-

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:15.380
Yep, we lost.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.580
But hey...

00:19:17.170 --> 00:19:18.710
It was a good game.

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:32.960
Butagoya ni
O dear pigsty

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:37.250
Hokori o idaite
The object of our pride

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:41.420
Hone o uzumete
Where we'll bury our bones

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:45.670
Seabura dase
And offer our backfat

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:49.960
Goshujin sama ni mi o sasage
For our masters in complete servitude

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.960
Buhi buta
