Ton~to~koto~n
Oinky Doink Cafe!

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:58.000
<i>Nerula, we got through a good, honest game!</i>

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:05.960
You've aged, Ranko.

00:20:07.460 --> 00:20:08.670
Uzuko!

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:10.250
So you're alive and well.

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:12.040
Why would you assume I was dead?

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:14.830
Because I searched for you, but in vain.

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:18.580
Ranko, I've climbed to the very top of Akiba.

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.750
I go by Nagi now.

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:22.290
Nagi?

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:24.290
You mean the head of the Creatureland Group?

00:20:24.290 --> 00:20:25.290
Yes.

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:29.380
What do you suppose Miss Michiyo
would say if she saw me now?

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:32.330
I must apologize.

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:34.630
It was because of me that Miss Michiyo...

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:38.330
If only you had taken up your gun
before that all happened.

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:42.000
The Maidalien woman with the red bat...

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.330
You didn't kill her.

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:44.960
Well...

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:48.080
That brand of foolishness got Miss Michiyo killed.

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:52.330
Is drawing with ketchup
the only thing this hand can do?

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:54.000
You know it's not.

00:20:57.380 --> 00:20:59.830
Ranko, we're about to start our meeting!

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:01.170
Right.

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:04.420
Fight for the sake of the group.

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:07.750
Otherwise, you'll have no place here in Akiba.

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:11.710
You're a bit too old now for all this "moe moe kyun."

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:16.920
Do you know her?

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:19.290
Yes, we were colleagues in the past.

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:21.880
That's quite the deluxe outfit.

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:26.830
Ugaki was already dead at the end.

00:21:27.500 --> 00:21:28.790
I see.

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:31.250
What good work by an unexpected intruder.

00:21:31.250 --> 00:21:34.210
That clears up the last of the obstacles.

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:37.540
Well, I don't know about that.

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:40.500
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:42.000
