00:21:48.460 --> 00:21:51.420
I wanted to show Nerula that
I'm doing fine as soon as possible!

00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:53.670
I'm going to dream pig and go go!

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:55.920
Dream pig, go go!

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:03.500
Fight for the sake of the group.

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:08.420
Otherwise, you'll have no place here in Akiba.

